OL,3,GNEWSATriple killing suspect's knife
OL,4,Aleft in woods for days
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: The following report contains
OL,7,Fdetails that some may find distressing
OL,9,FA bloodstained knife and blanket later
OL,10,Fforensically linked to a suspected
OL,11,Ftriple killer were reported to police
OL,12,Fthree days before the murders but not
OL,13,Frecovered until afterwards, the BBC has
OL,14,Flearned.
OL,16,FThey were found by a member of the
OL,17,Fpublic in woods at Costessey, near
OL,18,FNorwich, close to the home of
OL,19,FBartlomiej Kuczynski, who is thought to
OL,20,Fhave killed his two daughters and
OL,21,Fsister-in-law, and then himself.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
